    {
      "id": "claim_66c8cdf2e322499f9163f44abcb9af36",
      "statement": "The repository-root composite action runs one headless dcode task: it installs dcode through uvx, runs in `working_directory`, exports the provider and GitHub credential inputs as environment variables, and translates its supported action inputs into dcode flags before selecting either `--non-interactive` prompt delivery or `--stdin` prompt delivery.",
